WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.125
♪ Another one bites the dust ♪

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.167
♪ Let's go! ♪

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.583
(door alarm buzzing)

00:00:08.583 --> 00:00:11.250
(tense music)
(cell doors clanking)

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.833
[M] Gus March-Phillips.
(handcuffs rattling)

00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:16.250
I have a mission I want
you to lead.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:17.375
(dramatic music)

00:00:17.375 --> 00:00:18.875
Thank you, Sergeant.

00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:19.833
[Gus] What's the plan?

00:00:19.833 --> 00:00:22.500
- To neutralize the German
U-boats in the North Atlantic.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.125
(dramatic music)

00:00:24.125 --> 00:00:24.958
(telegraph tapping)

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:26.208
[Churchill] We're losing the
war.

00:00:26.208 --> 00:00:27.333
(dramatic music)

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:30.875
Hitler is not playing by the
rules, so neither are we.

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:33.750
(dramatic music)

00:00:34.625 --> 00:00:38.625
- We both know that I'm not very
popular

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:39.500
with the administration.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.125
- The reason they find you
unattractive

00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:44.375
is the very reason I find you
attractive.

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:47.333
("Another One Bites the Dust")

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:49.208
- If I'm to do this,
I'll need my own team.

00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:51.250
(guns cocking)

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.500
You won't like them.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.500
♪ Let's go ♪

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.333
[Gus] They're all, uh...

00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:57.000
[Both] No!

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.083
- mad.

00:00:58.083 --> 00:00:59.333
- They'll need to be.

00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:01.500
♪ Steve walks warily down the
street ♪

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.875
♪ With the brim pulled way down
low ♪

00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:05.833
[Gus] This is an unsanctioned,
unauthorized mission.

00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:07.958
♪ Machine guns ready to go ♪

00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:08.750
♪ Are you ready ♪

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:09.875
♪ Are you ready for this ♪
- If we fail,

00:01:09.875 --> 00:01:11.208
England will be condemned

00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:13.375
to a lifetime under the German
boot.

00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:15.250
♪ The bullets rip ♪

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:18.125
♪ To the sound of the beat, yeah
♪

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:20.000
[Joker] And so I said, "That is
not a dog.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.208
That is my wife!"

00:01:21.208 --> 00:01:22.458
(group laughing)

00:01:22.458 --> 00:01:25.000
(Gus laughing)

00:01:25.875 --> 00:01:27.083
- It's very good.

00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:27.875
♪ Let's go ♪

00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:30.375
(guns firing)

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:33.875
(dramatic music)

00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:35.958
♪ Another one bites the dust ♪

00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:38.250
♪ And another one's gone,
and another one's gone ♪

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:41.208
♪ Another one bites the dust ♪

00:01:41.208 --> 00:01:42.500
♪ Gonna get you, too ♪

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:43.375
♪ Another one ♪

00:01:43.375 --> 00:01:44.875
[Admiral Pound] You and your
operation are reckless.

00:01:44.875 --> 00:01:46.250
(explosion booms)
♪ Another one bites the dust ♪

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:47.125
♪ Hey, hey ♪

00:01:47.125 --> 00:01:47.958
♪ Another one bites ♪

00:01:47.958 --> 00:01:49.125
- Abort this mission now!

00:01:49.125 --> 00:01:51.000
♪ Another one bites the dust ♪
(explosion booms)

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.625
- Hello? Can't hear you.

00:01:52.625 --> 00:01:55.375
Please do-
(static crackling)

00:01:55.375 --> 00:01:56.833
(grenade pin pings)
(German officer gasps)

00:01:56.833 --> 00:01:58.833
♪ Another one, another one ♪
(explosion booms)

00:01:58.833 --> 00:02:01.000
♪ Another one bites the dust ♪

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.875
(dramatic music)

